<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάτᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατείνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extension,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὕψος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.44.3
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> abs.,
				<i>height,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				6.9.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὀρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phlp.
					<u>in Mete.</u>
					37.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stretching out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοντίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					17
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>threats</i> of violence, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.4.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				108
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ ἀ. καὶ ἀπειλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epict.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				38.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>intensity, inflexibility,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ φρονήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; <i>intensity</i> of passion, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.29O.
			</span></i>: abs., <i>courage, steadfastness,</i> prob in <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				34.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>endurance of hunger, fasting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.62a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῆς βοῆς</span>
			<i>straining,</i> Sch <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				149
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀνάτασιν</span> of the
				<i>acute accent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				620.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> metaph.,
				<i>straining, effort,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.31
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρὸς τὸ ἓν διαγνώσεως ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, al.: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.Gaz.
					<u>Pan.</u>
					496.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
